        },
        "quote": "The Topeka Landmarks Commission shall have the following functions:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.230.020 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "25040c48-2d01-54cd-a49e-9e2096c2c8d6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 190,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:1",
          "start": 68
        },
        "quote": "(a) Administer the identification, documentation and designation of local historic landmarks and local historic districts.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.230.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "4a567513-6aa7-52fc-8d6e-7ec102733ba7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 406,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:2",
          "start": 191
        },
        "quote": "(b) Determine whether certain buildings, structures, land areas, and interiors (only for local historic landmarks and with owner consent) should be designated as local historic landmarks or local historic districts.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.230.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "fac3307c-ca30-5a4e-bc0f-af2d96aea246",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 571,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:3",
          "start": 407
        },
        "quote": "(c) Administer certificate of appropriateness reviews according to design review guidelines to determine whether to grant or deny approval of proposed undertakings.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.230.020 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "a58c09e1-8c22-572c-b418-f142d6d73079",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 729,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:4",
          "start": 572
        },
        "quote": "(d) Review and comment on projects which may pose a threat to a recorded archaeological site as designated by the City or the Kansas State Historical Office.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
