          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.230.020:block:10",
          "start": 1259
        },
        "quote": "(j) Implement a receivership program for conservation easement donations for the purpose of historic preservation. Such easements shall be held by the City and monitored by the Topeka Landmarks Commission.",
